IGW-P4 Introduction
================================

The <igw-p4> package is organized as follows

    p4src/
	   igw pipeline source code by p4 language 

    igw-h/
        init_setup:
            Include bf_switchd daemon, hostif create, port manager, and hostif.json config file must be placed in /etc/ directory. you need modify makefile to decide which sde version you use.
        rpc_client:
            Python program used to initialize some static p4 tables which can run on remote machines 
    tools/
	  bfrt-apigen-tool:
        	Used to generate P4 bf-interface code file
	  frr:
        	frr.conf which put in /etc/frr/
	  pythonlib:
        	python dependencies lib
